{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/7e3563a5ba1421e9bac784fb5adffca6.avif?t=1762804514\" width=694 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/c1b3cab85ddbab24f17e442e82984e2b.poster.avif?t=1762804514\" width=900 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/c1b3cab85ddbab24f17e442e82984e2b.webm?t=1762804514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Ambrose, a cybernetic detective of the Cerebroid race. Once renowned for your mind-augmenting abilities, you now suffer their collapse. You awaken at a strange altar with only your ID and a letter from a missing doctor who claims to hold your cure. Find him before madness consumes you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/5da9e566837780a34f883ced3c41d00d.avif?t=1762804514\" width=647 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/f630220d04b939212bf58545c5aeb888.poster.avif?t=1762804514\" width=900 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/f630220d04b939212bf58545c5aeb888.webm?t=1762804514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The quarry\u2019s denizens may know what happened to the doctor, but they won\u2019t share willingly. By studying their speech and behavior, you can adapt your personality to earn trust, manipulate conversations, and extract the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/a940cdd33629427ab4a6cae39f39bbac.avif?t=1762804514\" width=590 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/04aec611e68ebf7bea88efdf565e64df.poster.avif?t=1762804514\" width=900 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/04aec611e68ebf7bea88efdf565e64df.webm?t=1762804514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The quarry has swallowed countless into its depths, and now those endless tunnels conceal the truth you seek. Explore ancient ruins, scavenge for clues, and descend deeper where locals dare not tread. But beware... what lurks below may not let you return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/ab425d3da39d1c8d108579e1def64194.avif?t=1762804514\" width=851 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/9a33761be3849f1f3c6e57b364793d9a.poster.avif?t=1762804514\" width=900 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/9a33761be3849f1f3c6e57b364793d9a.webm?t=1762804514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you push your augments, the faster your mind unravels. Hallucinations hound you at every turn. Engage with these phantoms for clues, or resist them to protect your sanity. Survival demands you walk a razor\u2019s edge between insight and madness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a <strong>cybernetic detective</strong> on the brink of insanity.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for a <strong>vanished doctor</strong> in a labyrinthine quarry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Augment your psyche</strong> to manipulate others and <strong>alter outcomes.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bargain your <strong>sanity for insight</strong> as hallucinations take hold.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore long-forgotten depths where <strong>truth and nightmare intertwine</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2912780?t=1762804514","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762804514","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/34ec5baf217e3ca50fc6c013d4ddee06ebc6bb50/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762804514","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/34ec5baf217e3ca50fc6c013d4ddee06ebc6bb50/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762804514","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Written references to violence and murder. Societal issues, such as negative perceptions of fictional groups. Dystopic setting containing criminal activities. Subjugation of fictional peoples due to fake in-universe historical events."},"demos":[{"appid":3247850,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/7e3563a5ba1421e9bac784fb5adffca6.avif?t=1762804514\" width=694 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/c1b3cab85ddbab24f17e442e82984e2b.poster.avif?t=1762804514\" width=900 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/c1b3cab85ddbab24f17e442e82984e2b.webm?t=1762804514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Ambrose, a cybernetic detective of the Cerebroid race. Once renowned for your mind-augmenting abilities, you now suffer their collapse. You awaken at a strange altar with only your ID and a letter from a missing doctor who claims to hold your cure. Find him before madness consumes you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/5da9e566837780a34f883ced3c41d00d.avif?t=1762804514\" width=647 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/f630220d04b939212bf58545c5aeb888.poster.avif?t=1762804514\" width=900 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/f630220d04b939212bf58545c5aeb888.webm?t=1762804514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The quarry\u2019s deni