7b364793d9a.webm?t=1762804514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you push your augments, the faster your mind unravels. Hallucinations hound you at every turn. Engage with these phantoms for clues, or resist them to protect your sanity. Survival demands you walk a razor\u2019s edge between insight and madness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a <strong>cybernetic detective</strong> on the brink of insanity.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for a <strong>vanished doctor</strong> in a labyrinthine quarry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Augment your psyche</strong> to manipulate others and <strong>alter outcomes.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bargain your <strong>sanity for insight</strong> as hallucinations take hold.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore long-forgotten depths where <strong>truth and nightmare intertwine</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Lost Gate Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/7c4c5ef842c57260a803dd2c3f218789a6b55da5/header.jpg?t=1762804514","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2912780/1266640651/6927395f0d2e6c192c303e9987c2c6fc98df4947/1761696356/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762804447","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2912780/1266640651/6927395f0d2e6c192c303e9987c2c6fc98df4947/1761696356/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762804447","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2912780/1266640651/6927395f0d2e6c192c303e9987c2c6fc98df4947/1761696356/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762804447","id":257214418,"name":"Horror Gameplay Teaser- MIN